# Architecture docs (local agent-generated, not tracked).
# The root ARCHITECTURE.md is the exception: it is a deliberate map of the
# pipeline and the seams, written to be read by the next person on this repo.
INTERVENTION_LOGIC.md
MEMORY.md

# Analysis reports (local notes, not tracked)
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/`: git never descends into an excluded directory,
# so the negation below only works if the directory itself stays visible.
docs/*
# Two exceptions, each narrow: the agent-skill configuration, which CLAUDE.md
# points at, and the architecture decision records. Both have to travel with the
# repo. Everything else under docs/ stays local notes, deliberately.
!docs/agents/
!docs/adr/
!docs/measurements.md
cursor_steps/
IRB/
# prompt-management-system: the authoring tool was removed from the repo on 2026-09-14.
# A local copy may remain, with its own .env; it must never be re-added.
prompt-management-system/
# Pilot data exports carry participant messages. Never commit them.
server/pilot-export.json
# Stray paths removed on 2026-09-14. Ignored so they cannot come back and reach a
# deploy to sumin6475/hait-turn-taking (scripts/deploy-turn-taking.sh refuses them too).
.pnpm-store/
.vscode.local-backup/
/final-touch/
